
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Happy Birthday!</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6d365 0%, #fda085 100%);
      height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .blob {
      position: absolute;
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
      background: #ff9a9e;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(100px);
      opacity: 0.5;
      animation: moveBlob 8s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .blob:nth-child(1) { top: 10%; left: 5%; }
    .blob:nth-child(2) { bottom: 10%; right: 5%; background: #fad0c4; }

    @keyframes moveBlob {
      0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
      100% { transform: translate(30px, -20px); }
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 90%;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .card img {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border: 5px solid #fda085;
    }

    .card h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #ff6f61;
    }

    .card p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #444;
    }

    /* Particle (blot) style */
    .particle {
      position: absolute;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 50%;
      opacity: 0.8;
      animation: floatUp 4s ease-in infinite;
    }

    @keyframes floatUp {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(100vh) scale(0.5);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      100% {
        transform: translateY(-10vh) scale(1);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Floating blobs background -->
  <div class="blob"></div>
  <div class="blob"></div>

  <!-- Card content -->
  <div class="card">
    <img src="bava.jpg" alt="Birthday Person" />
    <h1>🎉Wishing You Happiest Birthday Bava 🎉</h1>
    <p>Wishing you endless joy, unforgettable memories,<br>
    From crazy laughter to silly fights, from sharing our wins to cribbing over bad days — you're more than just family, you're a partner-in-crime in every season of life.

You always say, "We’ll go on a trip!"... and I’m still waiting — but hey, that dream keeps us going! 😅
You may irritate me like no one else, but life’s a lot more entertaining because of you.

Wishing you a day full of joy, and a year filled with success, laughter, and maybe… finally… that long-awaited trip! 🧳🌍

Have an epic birthday! 🎂🎈🎁 </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Script for creating animated particles (like floating blots) -->
  <script>
    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) {
      const particle = document.createElement("div");
      particle.classList.add("particle");
      particle.style.left = `${Math.random() * 100}vw`;
      particle.style.animationDuration = `${3 + Math.random() * 3}s`;
      particle.style.background = `hsl(${Math.random() * 360}, 70%, 80%)`;
      document.body.appendChild(particle);
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
